  <p>
    And here are some pictures of my old bikes that I used to ride back in Turkey. The one on the left is a
    Regal Raptor DD-250E-10 (“Spider 250”), a very nice-looking bike with a long fork (turns like a semi 🙂
    ). On the right is a Hyosung GV250 cruiser, which was a much better ride than the Spider in
    terms of build quality and drivetrain. My brother rode ~700–800 km (~500 miles) with that model (his own bike),
    and I did a ~1,400 km (~800 miles) trip with mine before eventually selling it when I moved to the US.
  </p>
